# DATABASE_URL convention for backend (Neon only — no local Postgres/Docker).
#
# This file is documentation only: no dotenv dependency, nothing is auto-loaded.
# Set the environment variable yourself before running migrations or the seed:
#
#   PowerShell:  $env:DATABASE_URL = "postgres://user:password@host/dbname?sslmode=require"
#   bash/zsh:    export DATABASE_URL="postgres://user:password@host/dbname?sslmode=require"
#
# Example pooled Neon connection string (branch-specific):
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@ep-xxxx-pooler.region.aws.neon.tech/dbname?sslmode=require